WEBVTT

00:00.080 --> 00:01.473
Think 3% down buys

00:01.473 --> 00:02.890
Dubai cheap? Look at

00:02.890 --> 00:03.557
day one.

00:03.677 --> 00:05.900
Booking is 27K; fees

00:05.900 --> 00:08.202
hit 40K. That's 60%

00:08.202 --> 00:09.565
lost to fees.

00:09.685 --> 00:12.585
Before 2029 keys, 520K

00:12.585 --> 00:14.635
locks up earning zero rent.

00:14.755 --> 00:16.412
Wait, walk next door:

00:16.412 --> 00:19.768
209 built homes averaged 323K.

00:19.908 --> 00:21.685
Same size, nearly triple

00:21.685 --> 00:23.919
the price: 566K extra

00:23.919 --> 00:25.028
just to wait.

00:25.168 --> 00:27.240
When reselling, 57 competing

00:27.240 --> 00:29.051
launches stack up nearby.

00:29.171 --> 00:30.771
Ready sales now beat

00:30.771 --> 00:34.269
off-plan: 18.1B to 16.7B.

00:34.389 --> 00:36.392
Still, delaying 46% past

00:36.392 --> 00:38.465
handover eases cash, keeping

00:38.465 --> 00:39.957
SKID at 6.6.

00:40.097 --> 00:41.701
Always compare day-one fees

00:41.701 --> 00:43.319
and next-door sales first.

00:43.439 --> 00:44.368
Check any tower free

00:44.368 --> 00:45.657
on skid.homes.
